<title>POLAND: Poland offers PLN 300 mln 1-year bonds on July 30.</title>
<headline>Poland offers PLN 300 mln 1-year bonds on July 30.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-07-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Polish finance ministry will offer 300 million zlotys of floating one-year bonds, maturing on September 3, 1998, at a primary tender on July 30, it said in a statement on Tuesday.</p>
</text>
